NAS (Network Attached Storage)
👉 Storage shared as files over a network

PC ──┐
Laptop ──┼── NAS
Phone ──┘
it is used for file sharing, backuops or home media storage




SAN (Storage Area Network)
👉 Storage shared as disks/drives over a dedicated network

Server ── SAN ── Storage Array

it is used for databases, virtual machines or high performance applications
